127
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:33,380
Most people with dementia will wander at least once.

128
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:34,980
Many will do so repeatedly.

129
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:39,220
Scientists don't know exactly why it happens,

130
00:07:39,220 --> 00:07:41,940
but inside the brain of a dementia patient,

131
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:43,940
the nerve cells are dying,

132
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:46,180
