134
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:52,300
One day, a neighbor finds Jay walking around

135
00:07:52,300 --> 00:07:54,780
in the snow without shoes.

136
00:07:54,780 --> 00:07:59,540
Another time, a landscaping worker finds him standing at an intersection more than a mile

137
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:03,420
