139
00:08:12,020 --> 00:08:16,100
Some people start to wonder if Patty is taking on too much.

140
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:24,340
Being the town's welfare officer and a caretaker for someone with dementia, that's a lot.

141
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:29,860
And then in March 2024, Jay makes the evening news.

142
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:30,860
He's disappeared.

143
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:36,900
Right now Epsom police are searching for a 76-year-old man with dementia.

144
00:08:36,900 --> 00:08:39,020
Police think he wandered away from his residence.

145
00:08:39,020 --> 00:08:40,420
But the timing in this story...

146
